invalid type: string "responsive when you use it the next day. \nChapter 15: Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ) \nQ1: Will adding Sigma-PA slow down my internet or corporate network speeds? \nNo. When used in its standard Passive Mode, the device only reads a duplicate copy of your \ntraffic sent from a switch port. It doesn't touch the original traffic, meaning it has zero impact on \n network \nÿÿ